{"title":"밟고, 차고, 사랑하고","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=0jJZj/dJMcagxbj8T/k8R1nHdqBvdK7NvQotsIxk&filename=th3","synopsis":"매일 회사 일로 바쁜 직장인 카호의 유일한 즐거움은 바에서 알게 된 아키라라는 남자와 함께 한잔하며 스스럼없이 얘기하는 것. 서른 살에 동안인 아키라지만 술, 담배를 즐기고 여자관계도 문란한 폐급 요소가 가득. 하지만 친구로서는 좋은 관계를 쌓고 있었다. \n...어느 날 밤, 선을 넘기 전까지는. ‘너, 의외로 경계심이 없네’ ‘차라리 죽어, 쓰레기 자식!!!’ 동안 서른 줄 폐급 남자 X 능력 빵빵 전문직 30대 여자가 펼치는 어른들의 오작동 거리감 러브(?) 코미디!\n\nⓒSumi Ichiya 2021/ KADOKAWA CORPORATION","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[],"weekly":[],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":152,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":152,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":152,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":153,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":250,"change":{"type":"down","amount":98}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}}]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":104105,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":104121,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":104124,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":104127,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":104145,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":104164,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":104166,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":104192,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":104194,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":104196,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":104197,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":104210,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"cc":220},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":104280,"rc":593,"rs":5620,"